	 ('296575c1-10ca-4c06-80ef-42793e8bafc1'::uuid,'WKT 143','Work Term I','Selected and approved co-op students will have completed up to semester 4 of the School of Accounting and Finance program requirements with a clear standing. Enrolment in this course is conditional on the student obtaining and accepting a co-op placement offer from an approved corporate partner.  The co-op position must relate to either Accounting or Finance.  Work that engages students at a high level of complexity is encouraged. This course is graded on a pass/fail basis.','https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2019-2020/courses/work-term/WKT/143/','2019-2020','None','None','None','None',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
