	 ('f103b6ae-f0b2-4351-a647-3a4554024749'::uuid,'WKT 608','GCM Internship','The GCM internship enables GCM students to obtain relevant workplace experience from an approved company in the graphic communications industry. Assessment includes regular student journal entries, the employer''s assessment of the intern''s performance, and a final report. Throughout assessment, students focus on the application of management theories and practices in the workplace. The course coordinator instructor may visit interns during the term. This course is taken in conjunction with a work term assignment.','https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2022-2023/courses/work-term/WKT/608/','2022-2023','None','GCM 220 and GCM 370 and GCM 375','None','None',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
