	 ('26794af7-53cc-43c1-b97d-f16319898b39'::uuid,'WKT 418','Work Term IV - Aerospace Engineering','Co-operative work placement in the aerospace: design, manufacturing, propulsion, and controls industries. Working directly with engineers and other skilled professionals, participants will gain experience in several different settings. This course is graded on a pass/fail basis.','https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2023-2024/courses/work-term/WKT/418/','2023-2024','None','None','None','None',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
	 ('d6a46c96-9d7d-4c24-825d-ef93d14472b8'::uuid,'WKT 503','Work Term V - Computer Science','Co-op position must be discipline related and should involve project work. This course is graded on a pass/fail basis.','https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2023-2024/courses/work-term/WKT/503/','2023-2024','None','None','None','None',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
	 ('83cb0bff-1a11-43bb-9383-4f840a0d1684'::uuid,'WKT 228','Work Term II - Mechatronics Engineering','Co-operative work term placement with an approved industrial partner, in a professional working environment, interacting directly with engineers and other skilled professionals. Participants will gain valuable experience in several different settings. This course is graded on a pass/fail basis.','https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2023-2024/courses/work-term/WKT/228/','2023-2024','None','None','None','None',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
	 ('84de2bb1-df98-496d-a270-578f413b41f1'::uuid,'WKT 312','Work Term III - Hospitality and Tourism','Enrolment requires a clear academic standing of 5th and 6th semester academic requirements and on the student obtaining and accepting a co-op placement offer from an approved corporate partner.  Co-op position must be in the Hospitality and Tourism industry.  A routine type of position is acceptable but supervisor and/or managerial work is encouraged.  This work term should build on the experience of the 2nd work term. This course is graded on a pass/fail basis.','https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2023-2024/courses/work-term/WKT/312/','2023-2024','None','None','None','None',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
	 ('994be012-2d85-46a1-bc05-425be5052537'::uuid,'WKT 335','Work Term III - Marketing','Co-op position must be related to Marketing Management and should progressively demand more of the student than the first two work terms. This course is graded on a pass/fail basis.','https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2023-2024/courses/work-term/WKT/335/','2023-2024','None','None','None','None',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
	 ('37279d90-b4bf-4f36-9d54-78b0fd2256d0'::uuid,'WKT 403','Work Term IV - Computer Science','Co-op position must be discipline related and should involve project work. This course is graded on a pass/fail basis.','https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2023-2024/courses/work-term/WKT/403/','2023-2024','None','None','None','None',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
	 ('aad51fa0-52b0-4d55-9a88-401b47036241'::uuid,'WKT 104','Work Term I - Retail Management','Work must be program-related (Retail Management) and may be entry-level or junior in responsibility and content. This course is graded on a pass/fail basis.','https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2023-2024/courses/work-term/WKT/104/','2023-2024','None','None','None','None',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
	 ('6acefa62-f58a-4e8a-8500-298cefa48f07'::uuid,'WKT 506','Work Term III - Science','Co-op position must be discipline related. Position should involve project work but some routine work is acceptable. This course is graded on a pass/fail basis.','https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2023-2024/courses/work-term/WKT/506/','2023-2024','None','None','None','None',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
	 ('3b3203b4-144d-4686-b47b-7cd87a2595e5'::uuid,'WKT 260','Work Term II - Accounting','Selected and approved co-op students will have completed up to semester 5 of the School of Accounting and Finance program requirements with a clear standing. Enrolment in this course is conditional on the student obtaining and accepting a co-op placement offer from an approved corporate partner. The co-op position must relate to Accounting. Work that engages students at a higher level of complexity than the first term is encouraged. The student will be using the skills they picked up from WKT 160 and applying them to the new position. This course is graded on a pass/fail basis.','https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2023-2024/courses/work-term/WKT/260/','2023-2024','None','None','None','None',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
	 ('f44e41b3-8b0e-40ba-ab46-73bb6f5b8345'::uuid,'WKT 419','Work Term IV - Biomedical Engineering','Co-operative work term placement with an approved industrial partner, in a professional working environment, interacting directly with engineers and other skilled professionals.  Participants will gain valuable experience in several different settings. This course is graded on a pass/fail basis.','https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2023-2024/courses/work-term/WKT/419/','2023-2024','None','None','None','None',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
