	 ('2501ab5d-3f8c-4719-8d4a-f9005ea136b2'::uuid,'WKT 360','Work Term III - Accounting','Selected and approved co-op students will have completed up to semester 6 of the School of Accounting and Finance program requirements with a clear standing. Enrolment in this course is conditional on the student obtaining and accepting a co-op placement offer from an approved corporate partner. The co-op position must relate to Accounting. Work that engages students at a higher level of complexity than the second term is encouraged. The student will be using the skills they picked up from WKT 260 and applying them to the new position. This course is graded on a pass/fail basis.','https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2024-2025/courses/work-term/WKT/360/','2024-2025','None','None','None','None',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
	 ('0fb15519-b345-4ffd-b701-4dae670b8ac5'::uuid,'WKT 217','Work Term II - Real Estate Management','Co-op position must be related to Real Estate Management and should build on the experience of the first work term. This course is graded on a pass/fail basis.','https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2024-2025/courses/work-term/WKT/217/','2024-2025','None','None','None','None',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
	 ('ee59237f-a1f4-4851-8c85-bf4535aa7433'::uuid,'WKT 327','Work Term III - Mechanical Engineering','Co-operative work term placement with an approved industrial partner, in a professional working environment, interacting directly with engineers and other skilled professionals.  Participants will gain valuable experience in several different settings. This course is graded on a pass/fail basis.','https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2024-2025/courses/work-term/WKT/327/','2024-2025','None','None','None','None',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
	 ('77348bd6-9e15-4cc3-a518-cc8d3f913d18'::uuid,'WKT 304','Work Term III - Retail Management','Work must be program-related (Retail Management) and should progressively demand more of the student than the first two terms by including some independent work or substantial responsibility for meeting specific objectives. This course is graded on a pass/fail basis.','https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2024-2025/courses/work-term/WKT/304/','2024-2025','None','None','None','None',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
	 ('51b8283c-37d0-4468-aafb-430d69cd0132'::uuid,'WKT 170','Work Term I - Interior Design','Co-operative work placement in the interior design industry. Working directly with professionals in the field, participants will gain experience in several different settings. This course is graded on a pass/fail basis.','https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2024-2025/courses/work-term/WKT/170/','2024-2025','Available only to students in Interior Design','None','None','None',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
	 ('2e543c93-e9ce-4b06-b6f5-3347fea85792'::uuid,'WKT 406','Work Term IV - Architectural Science','Co-operative work placement in the architecture, engineering and construction (AEC) industry. Working directly with architects, engineers and other skilled professionals from the AEC industry, participants will gain experience in several different settings. This course is graded on a pass/fail basis.','https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2024-2025/courses/work-term/WKT/406/','2024-2025','None','None','None','None',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
	 ('4f6a0bec-a0a6-4a45-adc7-5fb6763c8856'::uuid,'WKT 296','Double Work Term - Industrial Engineering','Co-operative work term placement with an approved industrial partner, in a professional working environment, interacting directly with engineers and other skilled professionals. This two semester work placement recognizes the experience gained by a student in the semester the student is enrolled in this course as well as in the previous semester while not enrolled in a work placement course. Participants will gain valuable experience in several different settings. This course is graded on a pass/fail basis.','https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2024-2025/courses/work-term/WKT/296/','2024-2025','None','None','None','None',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
	 ('da1bc5d3-7449-455f-9cfa-80ecc27f1637'::uuid,'WKT 500','Work Term II - Chemical Engineering','Co-op position must be engineering or science related. Routine type of positions are acceptable. This course is graded on a pass/fail basis.','https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2024-2025/courses/work-term/WKT/500/','2024-2025','None','None','None','None',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
