	 ('5a13cac5-5236-4b8e-9bba-3cba90787b3f'::uuid,'WKT 250','Work Term II - Arts','For students enrolled in the Co-op Program option. The co-op position must be related to the humanities and/or social sciences. Positions should involve project work but some routine work is acceptable. This course is graded on a pass/fail basis.','https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2024-2025/courses/work-term/WKT/250/','2024-2025','None','None','None','None',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
