	 ('d806696b-0bfc-41d6-9055-4302117383db'::uuid,'WKT 118','Work Term I - Aerospace Engineering','Co-operative work placement in the aerospace: design, manufacturing, propulsion, and controls industries. Working directly with engineers and other skilled professionals, participants will gain experience in several different settings. This course is graded on a pass/fail basis.','https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2024-2025/courses/work-term/WKT/118/','2024-2025','None','None','None','None',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
	 ('4bbb16a1-94a9-4543-a415-509c11686a1e'::uuid,'WKT 150','Work Term I - Arts','For students enrolled in the Co-op Program option. The co-op position must be related to the humanities and/or social sciences. Positions should involve project work but some routine work is acceptable. This course is graded on a pass/fail basis. Prerequisite: SSH 104','https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2024-2025/courses/work-term/WKT/150/','2024-2025','None','SSH 104','None','None',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
	 ('0355ff90-6454-4bff-ac44-f3468391f2b4'::uuid,'WKT 204','Work Term II - Retail Management','Work must be program related (Retail Management) and should build on the experience of the first work term. This course is graded on a pass/fail basis.','https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2024-2025/courses/work-term/WKT/204/','2024-2025','None','None','None','None',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
