	 ('7ecf5eea-8e78-4412-88e3-5f763d92bcd0'::uuid,'RTA 858','Music Production','Building on the basic and intermediate training in the first and second years of the program, this course is an advanced masterclass in music production. The course develops a foundation of recording sessions with live musicians and multi-track processes as well as digital composition and instrumentation techniques including synthesized, sampled, and virtual instruments. Beyond recording, students develop advanced techniques in overdubbing, mixing, signal-processing, and mastering.','https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2024-2025/courses/media/RTA/858/','2024-2025','None','RTA 311','None','None',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
